{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regolith</strong> is a space RPG where you explore, build structures, design infrastructure, craft items, gather materials, and battle enemies you encounter. In the beginning you will be doing these things manually, but slowly you will develop technology to scale up production, automate supply chains and manage massive systems. Careful base layout will be essential to maximize efficiency and ensure all your needs are met.<br><br>As your base expands, you\u2019ll gain the ability to fabricate increasingly powerful items that let you venture deeper into a vast, procedurally generated open world. But be warned: the depths of space hold many dangers, and you may need to strengthen your defenses to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922250/extras/ac14bd816f183f8736a8798872b10372.poster.avif?t=1759641964\" width=572 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922250/extras/ac14bd816f183f8736a8798872b10372.webm?t=1759641964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922250/extras/ac14bd816f183f8736a8798872b10372.mp4?t=1759641964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922250?t=1759641964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922250?t=1759641964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922250/4fc868a0737c4f3f2172a6c076183f183bf0054b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759641964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams